---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const lastUpdated = "May 2026";
---

<BaseLayout title="T.N. Hamilton | Now">
    <article class="mt-16 mb-24">
        <header class="mb-12">
            <h1
                class="text-4xl font-semibold mb-2 tracking-tight text-zinc-100"
            >
                Now
            </h1>
            <p class="text-sm font-mono text-gold/60 uppercase tracking-widest">
                Last Updated: {lastUpdated}
            </p>
        </header>

        <div class="space-y-16">
            <section>
                <h2
                    class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold font-bold mb-6 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-2"
                >
                    Professional & Academic
                </h2>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    <li>
                        <span class="text-zinc-200">Professional Focus:</span> I just
                        passed the GREM exam and am currently studying for the GPEN
                        exam. I'm super stoked to say that I hold the GREM certification!
                        Wish me luck on the GPEN!
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="text-zinc-200">Academic Studies:</span> Last
                        week, I finished my last final at USAFA! This not only marks
                        a huge milestone in my academic journey, but also my professional,
                        as I prepare to graduate and commission as a 2LT!
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>

            <section>
                <h2
                    class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-gold font-bold mb-6 border-b border-zinc-800 pb-2"
                >
                    Leisure Activities
                </h2>
                <ul class="space-y-4 text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed">
                    <li>
                        <span class="text-zinc-200">Current Reading:</span> I'm currently
                        reading
                        <span class="italic">Fear and Trembling</span> by Soren Kierkegaard.
                        After completing a philosophy course, I was inspired to read
                        further into how philosophers argue the existence of God or
                        a higher, more supernatural power. This book is just the first
                        in my library on this topic.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="text-zinc-200">Personal Hobbies:</span> I'm currently
                        researching local agentic AI solutions to further my productivity
                        with personal projects. Specifically, I'm experimenting with
                        Hermes Agent by Nous Research.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </section>
        </div>
    </article>
</BaseLayout>
